      </ol>

      <p><strong>Your bundle includes:</strong> Claim of Lien (MCL 570.1101 compliant) · Deadline confirmation · Wayne/Oakland/Kent county filing guide · Proof of service affidavit · Lien release form · Notice of Furnishing (if required for your role)</p>

      <p>No account required. Instant download.</p>

